ithout being seen. Stay hidden as you observe the family\u2019s daily routines and use the environment to your advantage. Explore their home and blend into their world without them ever knowing.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survival Mechanics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549140/extras/2d4c52f4f6bf17abcb6e5c869160c076.poster.avif?t=1751703389\" width=608 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549140/extras/2d4c52f4f6bf17abcb6e5c869160c076.webm?t=1751703389\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549140/extras/2d4c52f4f6bf17abcb6e5c869160c076.mp4?t=1751703389\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your needs and health matter. Eat well, rest, and take care of yourself while living with your new family. Maintain your health to stay alive. Every decision you make affects your survival.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Chores &amp; Cleaning</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549140/extras/de94d2d8e8d498e88a2a5ab5e3910ed0.poster.avif?t=1751703389\" width=608 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549140/extras/de94d2d8e8d498e88a2a5ab5e3910ed0.webm?t=1751703389\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549140/extras/de94d2d8e8d498e88a2a5ab5e3910ed0.mp4?t=1751703389\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep the house tidy without drawing attention. Clean up messes, organize items, and ensure everything is in its place. A messy home could raise suspicion and make your life even harder.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Stories &amp; Dynamic Family Behavior</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549140/extras/3d113080001c2a05c7c62dcb80e1ffeb.poster.avif?t=1751703389\" width=608 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549140/extras/3d113080001c2a05c7c62dcb80e1ffeb.webm?t=1751703389\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549140/extras/3d113080001c2a05c7c62dcb80e1ffeb.mp4?t=1751703389\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Observe the family\u2019s daily life. Each member has their own routine and personal stories. It\u2019s up to you to figure out how and when to interact with them.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Open-Ended Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549140/extras/c4a78b24a15cd7515139c2a88f89c17c.poster.avif?t=1751703389\" width=608 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549140/extras/c4a78b24a15cd7515139c2a88f89c17c.webm?t=1751703389\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549140/extras/c4a78b24a15cd7515139c2a88f89c17c.mp4?t=1751703389\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With sandbox-style freedom, you can choose how to approach every situation. Interact with objects and experiment with different ways to survive. The house is yours to explore.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Protect Your Family</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549140/extras/54ccfd1a87ce80eaf5df7ca331dab43c.poster.avif?t=1751703389\" width=608 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549140/extras/54ccfd1a87ce80eaf5df7ca331dab43c.webm?t=1751703389\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549140/extras/54ccfd1a87ce80eaf5df7ca331dab43c.mp4?t=1751703389\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch over your family from the shadows. Keep them safe without ever revealing yourself, ensuring their safety while staying hidden.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>How far will you go to be in someone\u2019s life?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549140/extras/2a7328da220599cead2341de1e98942d.avif?t=1751703389\" width=608 height=60 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2>",
